# LoopX code owners. Roster, eligibility and review service levels:
# .github/GOVERNANCE.md ("Maintainer And Review Roster", "Review Service Levels").
#
# GitHub applies the LAST matching pattern, so this file runs from broad to
# narrow: fallback, module map, subsystem routes, then governance paths.
# @loopx-agent shares every route; narrower rules must retain that owner.
# When a line lists several owners, approval from any one of them satisfies
# code-owner review.
#
# Only accounts with repository write access and an accepted, publicly recorded
# scope are listed. First-review contacts, pending invitations and read-only
# contributors are routed through GOVERNANCE.md, not through this file.

# Fallback for paths no module line claims, such as a new top-level directory.
* @huangruiteng @loopx-agent

